1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,300
Now when Jesus had finished these sayings, He went away from Galilee and entered the

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:13,520
region of Judea beyond the Jordan, and large crowds followed Him, and He healed them there.

3
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:17,180
And Pharisees came up to Him and tested Him by asking,

4
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:21,040
Is it lawful to divorce one's wife for any cause?

5
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:26,180
He answered, Have you not read that He who created them

6
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:30,060
from the beginning made them male and female, and said,

7
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:36,020
Therefore a man shall leave his father and his mother, and hold fast to his wife,

8
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:41,120
and the two shall become one flesh. So they are no longer two, but one flesh.

9
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:46,180
What therefore God has joined together, let not man separate.

10
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:51,440
They said to Him, Why then did Moses command one to give

11
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:55,600
a certificate of divorce and to send her away? He said to them,

12
00:00:56,180 --> 00:01:01,100
Because of your hardness of heart, Moses allowed you to divorce your wives,

13
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:07,800
but from the beginning it was not so. And I say to you, whoever divorces his wife,

14
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:12,280
except for sexual immorality, and marries another, commits adultery.

15
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:17,240
The disciples said to Him, If such is the case of a man with his wife,

16
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:20,920
it is better not to marry. But He said to them,

17
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:26,120
Not everyone can receive this saying, but only those to whom it is given.

18
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:31,760
For there are eunuchs who have been so from birth, and there are eunuchs who have been made

19
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:37,400
eunuchs by men. And there are eunuchs who have made themselves eunuchs for the sake of the

20
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:42,880
kingdom of heaven. Let the one who is able to receive this, receive it.

21
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:48,180
Then children were brought to Him that He might lay His hands on them and pray.

22
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:51,880
The disciples rebuked the people. But Jesus said,

23
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:56,160
Let the little children come to Me, and do not hinder them,

24
00:01:56,320 --> 00:02:02,660
for to such belongs the kingdom of heaven. And He laid His hands on them and went away.

25
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:10,700
And behold, a man came up to Him, saying, Teacher, what good deed must I do to have eternal life?

26
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:15,340
And He said to him, Why do you ask Me about what is good?

27
00:02:15,860 --> 00:02:20,740
There is only one who is good. If you would enter life, keep the commandments.

28
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:24,300
He said to him, Which ones?

29
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:25,900
And Jesus said,

30
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:32,240
You shall not murder, you shall not commit adultery, you shall not steal, you shall not

31
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:38,300
bear false witness. Honor your father and mother, and you shall love your neighbor as yourself.

32
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:44,040
The young man said to Him, All these I have kept, what do I still lack?

33
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:51,860
Jesus said to him, If you would be perfect, go, sell what you possess, and give to the poor,

34
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:55,720
and you will have treasure in heaven. And come,

35
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:56,660
follow Me.

36
00:02:57,260 --> 00:03:02,220
When the young man heard this, he went away sorrowful, for he had great possessions.

37
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:10,060
And Jesus said to His disciples, Truly I say to you, only with difficulty will a rich person

38
00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:16,580
enter the kingdom of heaven. Again I tell you, it is easier for a camel to go through the eye of a

39
00:03:16,580 --> 00:03:22,180
needle than for a rich person to enter the kingdom of God. When the disciples heard this,

40
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:24,260
they were greatly astonished, saying,

41
00:03:24,260 --> 00:03:26,540
Who then can be saved?

42
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:29,600
But Jesus looked at them and said,

43
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:36,040
With man this is impossible, but with God all things are possible.

44
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:39,180
Then Peter said in reply,

45
00:03:40,140 --> 00:03:44,720
See, we have left everything and followed you. What then will we have?

46
00:03:45,420 --> 00:03:46,860
Jesus said to them,

47
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:53,060
Truly I say to you, in the new world, when the Son of Man will sit on His glorious throne,

48
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:54,240
you who are the Son of Man, you will be saved. You who are the Son of Man, you who are the Son of Man,

49
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:59,480
you who have followed Me, will also sit on twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Israel.

50
00:04:00,180 --> 00:04:04,760
And everyone who has left houses, or brothers, or sisters, or father, or mother,

51
00:04:05,060 --> 00:04:11,760
or children, or lands, for My namesake, will receive a hundredfold, and will inherit eternal

52
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:17,140
life. But many who are first will be last, and the last first.

